Helper level (no frozen statement). Step 4 of route D for `ρ_X` (scratch `stageK/STATUS.md`,
session 26+; generated by `stageK/fxg/g1hlean.py`, numerators from `g1q.py`). Every summand of
the derivative identity of the rational part `formXG1h` is brought to the common denominator
`formXG1Dc = 24(X - 1)³K⁴(u - 1)²P²M³` (`formXG1H_t…`);
this file treats `r₁` (`formXG1H_tA`, `formXG1H_tB`) and the `F_a`, `F̃_b` summands; the
identity itself is `hasDerivAt_formXG1h` (`SetCKFormXG1H2`).
-/

@[expose] public section

open Real Set

namespace QED.ChainProof.SetCK

open QED.TwoLoop.UnitSCLimit QED.TwoLoop.UnitLLink

/-- The common denominator of the rational identity. -/
noncomputable def formXG1Dc (X u : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  24 * (X - 1) ^ 3 * formXK X ^ 4 * (u - 1) ^ 2 * (X ^ 2 + (1 - X) * u) ^ 2 * coordM X u ^ 3

section

